  <!-- In-Depth Clinical Guide: Teeth Whitening in Hennur -->
  <section class="py-16 px-6 lg:px-24 bg-japandi-sand/25 border-y border-japandi-clay/30">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
      
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium tracking-tight">
          The Science of Professional Laser Teeth Whitening Explained
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          Tooth enamel appears solid to the naked eye, but under microscopic examination, it consists of millions of crystalline hydroxyapatite prisms separated by microscopic organic pores. Over years of consuming South Indian filter coffee, black tea, spices like turmeric, red wine, and colored foods, organic pigment molecules (chromogens) penetrate deep within these pores. Surface brushing with standard commercial toothpaste only scrubs extrinsic superficial film; it cannot break the complex molecular bonds of intrinsic stains locked beneath the surface.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          At House of Dental in Hennur, our in-office laser whitening treatment utilizes stabilized, pH-neutral bleaching formulations. When activated by a specialized non-thermal blue LED and cold-laser wavelength, the formulation releases free oxygen radicals that penetrate deep into the enamel microstructure. These oxygen radicals specifically break the double bonds of dark chromogen molecules, converting them into colorless, light-reflecting compounds without changing or eroding your enamel mineral density.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Why Professional In-Office Whitening is Superior to DIY Kits -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          Professional Clinical Whitening vs. At-Home &amp; Over-the-Counter Products
        </h3>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-japandi-moss"></span>
              <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">House of Dentalal Whitening</h4>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside leading-relaxed">
              <li><strong>Hermetic Gum Barrier:</strong> We apply a light-cured resin dam over your gums, ensuring active peroxide never touches or burns soft tissues.</li>
              <li><strong>Immediate Results:</strong> Teeth brighten by 4 to 8 shades in a single 45-minute appointment, monitored by an aesthetic dentist.</li>
              <li><strong>Nano-Hydroxyapatite Remineralization:</strong> Post-treatment desensitizing paste seals enamel pores instantly, preventing sensitivity.</li>
              <li><strong>Zero Acid Erosion:</strong> Controlled pH-neutral chemistry maintains the structural integrity of your tooth enamel.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-japandi-clay"></span>
              <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Store-Bought DIY Kits &amp; Charcoal Powders</h4>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside leading-relaxed">
              <li><strong>Unregulated Gum Irritation:</strong> Poorly fitting generic trays cause gel leakage, resulting in painful chemical chemical burns on gums.</li>
              <li><strong>Enamel Abrasion:</strong> Activated charcoal and whitening powders contain abrasive grit that scratches and wears away outer enamel permanently.</li>
              <li><strong>Uneven, Blotchy Whitening:</strong> Non-customized application leads to patchy, spotty results, especially along the gum margins.</li>
              <li><strong>Chronic Sensitivity:</strong> Lack of professional remineralizing agents leaves teeth hypersensitive to cold air and beverages for weeks.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step-by-Step Procedure at Hennur Clinic -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          The 4-Step In-Office Teeth Whitening Protocol at House of Dental
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          Here is exactly what you will experience during your 45-minute smile transformation on Horamavu Agara Road:
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Step 1: Baseline Shade Matching &amp; Ultrasonic Polish</h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              We record your starting tooth shade on the standard VITA classical shade guide with high-resolution photography. We then perform a light ultrasonic polish to remove external plaque and tartar, ensuring direct contact between the whitening gel and enamel.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Step 2: Gingival Barrier Application</h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              A gentle lip retractor is positioned, and a liquid dam isolation barrier is painted carefully along your gum line and cured with blue light. This forms an impermeable rubberized seal that protects your gums completely throughout the procedure.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Step 3: Laser-Activated Bleaching Cycles (3 x 15 Minutes)</h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              The professional whitening gel is applied to the front surfaces of your upper and lower teeth. Our LED/laser accelerator light is positioned, activating the gel for 15 minutes. We repeat this for two to three gentle cycles depending on your target brightness.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Step 4: Remineralizing Enamel Glaze &amp; Final Reveal</h4>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              The gel and gum barrier are rinsed away. We apply a specialized nano-hydroxyapatite and potassium nitrate desensitizing treatment to soothe the nerves. We compare your brilliant new shade against your baseline photo, revealing a radiant, refreshed smile.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Post-Whitening 'White Diet' Protocol -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          The 48-Hour 'White Diet' Protocol for Long-Lasting Brilliance
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          For the first 48 hours following your laser whitening treatment, the microscopic enamel prisms remain slightly permeable and susceptible to absorbing deep pigments. Following our simple 'White Diet' locks in your radiant results:
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-japandi-cream/90 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <span class="font-semibold text-japandi-moss uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider block">Recommended Foods (Safe)</span>
            <ul class="space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
              <li>Plain steamed white rice, idlis, and plain dosas (without red chutney).</li>
              <li>White chicken, steamed fish, egg whites, paneer, and tofu.</li>
              <li>Milk, curd, plain yogurt, and clear soups.</li>
              <li>Peeled potatoes, cauliflower, and white pasta with white sauce.</li>
              <li>Water, coconut water, and clear liquids.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-japandi-sand/40 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-2">
            <span class="font-semibold text-japandi-clay uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider block">Foods to Avoid for 48 Hours</span>
            <ul class="space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
              <li>Coffee, black tea, green tea, and hot chocolate.</li>
              <li>Curries with heavy turmeric or bright red chili powders.</li>
              <li>Soy sauce, tomato ketchup, mustard, and balsamic vinegar.</li>
              <li>Red wine, dark beers, cola, and colored sports drinks.</li>
              <li>Berries (blueberries, blackberries), cherries, and beetroot.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pricing and Bridal Packages -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          Teeth Whitening Cost in Hennur, Bangalore &amp; Bridal Packages
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          We offer straightforward, all-inclusive pricing with zero hidden surcharges:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth space-y-2 font-light">
          <li><strong>In-Office Laser Teeth Whitening (Complete Session):</strong> ₹8,000 to ₹12,000 (includes scaling, gum barrier, and remineralization).</li>
          <li><strong>Bridal &amp; Groom Smile Radiance Package:</strong> ₹12,000 to ₹15,000 (includes deep ultrasonic scaling, air polishing, laser whitening, and home touch-up maintenance trays).</li>
          <li><strong>Dual Couple Smile Makeover Package:</strong> Special pricing when booking simultaneous consultations for weddings or corporate events.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Local Catchment & Transit Directions -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          Effortless Access from Hennur, Kalyan Nagar &amp; North Bangalore
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed">
          House of Dental is centrally located at 2nd Floor, SLV Nilaya, Horamavu Agara Road (beside Nayara Petrol Bunk), making it a convenient stop before upcoming weddings, photo shoots, and family celebrations:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-xs sm:text-sm text-japandi-earth space-y-1.5 font-light">
          <li><strong>Hennur Bande &amp; Geddalahalli:</strong> 2 to 5 minutes by car or two-wheeler.</li>
          <li><strong>Horamavu &amp; Babusapalya:</strong> 5 to 7 minutes via Horamavu Agara Road.</li>
          <li><strong>Kalyan Nagar, HRBR Layout &amp; Kammanahalli:</strong> 10 minutes via Hennur Road.</li>
          <li><strong>Thanisandra, Kothanur &amp; Byrathi:</strong> 8 to 12 minutes along the northern corridor.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm text-japandi-earth font-light leading-relaxed pt-2">
          Dedicated car and bike parking is provided on premise, and we are open on Sundays (9:30 AM to 9:00 PM) for weekend appointments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Internal Links Cluster -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-japandi-sand/50 border border-japandi-clay/50 space-y-4">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          Explore Related Specialty Treatments &amp; Local Care Portals:
        </h4>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-japandi-moss font-medium">
